{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "fxkit",
 "version": "0.1.0",
 "title": "fxkit",
 "description": "Effects on the Digitone's audio inputs as a framework: the effects list (fx_effects) every effect pedal adds itself to, the audio owner that hands an effect the inputs and the output, parameter locks on an effect's controls kept in a track's lock table and replayed on their steps through the note queue, and the project data that saves each effect's settings. irpina's fxkit 0.1 from elekloader. On its own it changes nothing the unit does.",
 "category": "system",
 "author": "irpina",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
